Package: autornaR
Type: Package
Title: Comprehensive RNAseq Data Analysis and Visualization
Version: 0.2.9
Authors@R: 
    person("Luiz", "Garcia", 
           email = "luiz.cardoso@ufpr.br", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9616-0927"))
Description: Designed to streamline the analysis of RNA-seq data. 
    It provides tools for importing and validating count matrices, normalizing expression data, 
    performing quality control, exploratory analyses, dimensionality reduction (PCA/UMAP), 
    differential expression analyses, enrichment, correlation, heatmaps, volcano plots, ROC curves, 
    and statistical testing. The package is optimized for pairwise group comparisons 
    but can be applied to more complex experimental designs.
